 "synopsis": "Zetwerk Manufacturing Business is planning to raise around ₹5,000 crore through an initial public offering (IPO) in October 2026. The proposed issue comprises a fresh issue of ₹2,600 crore and an offer for sale (OFS) of up to 9.68 crore equity shares. The issue is scheduled to open on October 15 and close on October 19, 2026.",
